# Agent instruction files. `next dev` rewrites these whenever it detects an AI
# coding agent, and the block it writes has nothing project-specific in it.
# The regenerated copies stay usable locally; they just never enter git.
# Use `git add -f` if a hand-written one is ever worth tracking.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code local state (per-machine settings and review worktrees)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
